{"title":"A Road Worth Keeping","html":"<article class=\"wp g-page\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\"><span class=\"q-alert-banner\" role=\"alert\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span><b>This quest is not fully written yet.</b> Steps, items or dialogue may be missing.</span></span>Bram has enough people to run a supply patrol at last. Before they leave, he needs the kitchen stocked and the whole route checked.</p><section id=\"g-about\"><h2>About</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-facts\"><thead><tr><th></th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Given by</td><td><a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"bram-fen\">Show on map</button></td></tr><tr><td>Level</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>Length</td><td>Long</td></tr><tr><td>Kind</td><td>Side</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section id=\"g-needs\"><h2>What you need</h2><ul class=\"q-needs\"><li><a href=\"#/item/boar-meat\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/6878b1d140c68660cf33.svg\" alt=\"\">Boar Meat</a> <b>×6</b></li></ul></section><section id=\"g-steps\"><h2>Steps</h2><ol class=\"q-steps\"><li value=\"1\">Talk to <a href=\"#/npc/bram-fen\">Bram Fen</a> <span class=\"muted\">(outdoors near Imp Tree)</span> to get the quest. <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"bram-fen\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"2\">Ask Ada Fen what the supply patrol needs <span class=\"muted\">at 7, -22</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"7|-22|Ask Ada Fen what the supply patrol needs\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"3\">Bring Ada Fen 6 boar meat for the patrol <span class=\"muted\">(6)</span> - <a href=\"#/item/boar-meat\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/6878b1d140c68660cf33.svg\" alt=\"\">Boar Meat</a> <span class=\"muted\">at 7, -22</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"7|-22|Bring Ada Fen 6 boar meat for the patrol\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"4\">Ask Ellis Pike for the supply patrol route <span class=\"muted\">at 54, 13</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"54|13|Ask Ellis Pike for the supply patrol route\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"5\">Inspect the western snake ground <span class=\"muted\">at -89, 14</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"-89|14|Inspect the western snake ground\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"6\">Kill 8 small or medium coral snakes on the western approach <span class=\"muted\">(8)</span></li><li value=\"7\">Inspect the footpad camp south of town <span class=\"muted\">at 176, 110</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"176|110|Inspect the footpad camp south of town\">Show on map</button></li><li value=\"8\">Defeat 12 footpads before the supply patrol leaves <span class=\"muted\">(12)</span></li><li value=\"9\">Return to Bram Fen after preparing the full patrol route <span class=\"muted\">at 31, 48</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"spot\" data-map-id=\"31|48|Return to Bram Fen after preparing the full patrol route\">Show on map</button></li></ol></section><section id=\"g-rewards\"><h2>Rewards</h2><div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-rewards\"><thead><tr><th>Reward</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gold</td><td>300</td></tr><tr><td>Character XP</td><td>12,000</td></tr><tr><td>Quest points</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>Items</td><td><a href=\"#/item/health-potion-medium\"><img class=\"g-ico\" src=\"data/img/6003f0952eddf298b4c8.svg\" alt=\"\">Health Potion Medium</a> ×2</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></div>\n      <aside class=\"wp-infobox g-aside\"><h3>A Road Worth Keeping</h3><p class=\"g-aside-group\">Quests</p><p class=\"g-aside-h\">On this page</p><ol class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-road-worth-keeping\" data-g-jump=\"g-about\">About</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-road-worth-keeping\" data-g-jump=\"g-needs\">What you need</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-road-worth-keeping\" data-g-jump=\"g-steps\">Steps</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/quest-binxonia-a-road-worth-keeping\" data-g-jump=\"g-rewards\">Rewards</a></li></ol><p class=\"g-aside-h\">Related guides</p><ul class=\"g-toc\"><li><a href=\"#/guide/quests\">All quests</a></li><li><a href=\"#/guide/travel\">Travel &amp; quests</a></li></ul><p class=\"g-aside-h\"><a href=\"#/guides\">All guides</a></p><p class=\"g-note\">From the game’s own data, what players have recorded, and the <a href=\"https://binxonia.com/guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">official guide</a>.</p></aside></article>"}